      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<h2 class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>East&nbsp;Asian&nbsp;Humanities&nbsp;Major&nbsp;Articulation&nbsp;Information</strong></h2><p class=\"ql-align-center\"></p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>East&nbsp;Asian&nbsp;Humanities</strong>&nbsp;major&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;comparative&nbsp;study&nbsp;of&nbsp;East&nbsp;Asian&nbsp;cultures.&nbsp;</p><p>The&nbsp;curriculum&nbsp;seeks&nbsp;to&nbsp;prepare&nbsp;students&nbsp;for&nbsp;cross-regional&nbsp;comparative&nbsp;work,&nbsp;emphasizing&nbsp;cultural&nbsp;and&nbsp;literary&nbsp;analysis,&nbsp;media&nbsp;studies,&nbsp;and&nbsp;interdisciplinary&nbsp;humanities.</p><p></p><p>The&nbsp;major&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;high&nbsp;degree&nbsp;of&nbsp;flexibility,&nbsp;allowing&nbsp;students&nbsp;to&nbsp;draw&nbsp;coursework&nbsp;from&nbsp;two&nbsp;or&nbsp;more&nbsp;national&nbsp;traditions&nbsp;in&nbsp;East&nbsp;Asia&nbsp;(China,&nbsp;Japan,&nbsp;and&nbsp;South&nbsp;Korea,&nbsp;among&nbsp;others)&nbsp;and&nbsp;covering&nbsp;both&nbsp;the&nbsp;modern&nbsp;and&nbsp;classical&nbsp;periods.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;must&nbsp;complete&nbsp;8&nbsp;courses&nbsp;(or&nbsp;40&nbsp;units),&nbsp;and&nbsp;while&nbsp;we&nbsp;recommend&nbsp;acquiring&nbsp;a&nbsp;reading&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;one&nbsp;foreign&nbsp;language,&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;entirely&nbsp;completed&nbsp;through&nbsp;English-taught&nbsp;courses.</p><p></p><h2>Direct&nbsp;Admission&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Major</h2><p>When&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;admitted&nbsp;to&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;Major&nbsp;in&nbsp;East&nbsp;Asian&nbsp;Humanities,&nbsp;you&nbsp;enter&nbsp;directly&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;major.&nbsp;There&nbsp;is&nbsp;no&nbsp;secondary&nbsp;application&nbsp;or&nbsp;declaration&nbsp;process&nbsp;after&nbsp;you&nbsp;arrive&nbsp;on&nbsp;campus.&nbsp;</p><p>You&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;full&nbsp;member&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;department&nbsp;from&nbsp;day&nbsp;one.</p><p></p><p>While&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;possible&nbsp;to&nbsp;change&nbsp;your&nbsp;major&nbsp;after&nbsp;you&nbsp;matriculate&nbsp;to&nbsp;Berkeley,&nbsp;switching&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;high-demand&nbsp;field&nbsp;like&nbsp;Business,&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Economics,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Psychology&nbsp;may&nbsp;require&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;pass&nbsp;a&nbsp;competitive&nbsp;comprehensive&nbsp;review&nbsp;process.&nbsp;Additionally,&nbsp;spending&nbsp;your&nbsp;time&nbsp;preparing&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;different&nbsp;program&nbsp;once&nbsp;you&nbsp;arrive&nbsp;on&nbsp;campus&nbsp;will&nbsp;cause&nbsp;a&nbsp;lack&nbsp;of&nbsp;progress&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;currently&nbsp;declared&nbsp;major,&nbsp;which&nbsp;can&nbsp;delay&nbsp;your&nbsp;graduation.&nbsp;</p><p>We&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;you&nbsp;choose&nbsp;the&nbsp;path&nbsp;that&nbsp;best&nbsp;supports&nbsp;your&nbsp;long-term&nbsp;goals&nbsp;and&nbsp;allows&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;graduate&nbsp;on&nbsp;time.</p><p></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Personal&nbsp;Advising&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Transition</strong></p><p>To&nbsp;support&nbsp;a&nbsp;smooth&nbsp;transition,&nbsp;all&nbsp;admitted&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;students&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;meet&nbsp;with&nbsp;our&nbsp;undergraduate&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;before&nbsp;enrolling&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;of&nbsp;classes.&nbsp;</p><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;our&nbsp;way&nbsp;of&nbsp;welcoming&nbsp;you&nbsp;and&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;your&nbsp;academic&nbsp;plan&nbsp;matches&nbsp;your&nbsp;interests&nbsp;and&nbsp;graduation&nbsp;goals.</p><p></p><p>You&nbsp;will&nbsp;receive&nbsp;detailed&nbsp;instructions&nbsp;on&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;schedule&nbsp;this&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;well&nbsp;before&nbsp;your&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;begins,&nbsp;either&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;summer&nbsp;Golden&nbsp;Bear&nbsp;Advising&nbsp;program&nbsp;or&nbsp;via&nbsp;a&nbsp;direct&nbsp;email&nbsp;from&nbsp;our&nbsp;department.&nbsp;</p><p>We&nbsp;look&nbsp;forward&nbsp;to&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;you&nbsp;and&nbsp;helping&nbsp;you&nbsp;plan&nbsp;your&nbsp;time&nbsp;at&nbsp;Berkeley.</p><p></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Advising:</strong></p><p>Students&nbsp;with&nbsp;questions&nbsp;about&nbsp;transferring&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;in&nbsp;East&nbsp;Asian&nbsp;Humanities&nbsp;are&nbsp;encouraged&nbsp;to&nbsp;contact&nbsp;our&nbsp;undergraduate&nbsp;major&nbsp;advisor(UMA):</p><p>Cassandra&nbsp;Dunn</p><p>Department&nbsp;Website:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://ealc.berkeley.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://ealc.berkeley.edu/</a></p><p>Email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:cassandrajj@berkeley.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cassandrajj@berkeley.edu</a></p><p>Appointments:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://calendly.com/cassandra-dunn-ug-advisor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule&nbsp;an&nbsp;appointment&nbsp;(in-person&nbsp;or&nbsp;remotely</a>).</p><p></p><h2><strong>LOWER&nbsp;DIVISION&nbsp;MAJOR&nbsp;REQUIREMENTS&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>Coursework&nbsp;for&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;completed&nbsp;upon&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;to&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley.&nbsp;</p><p>Students&nbsp;intending&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;should&nbsp;enroll&nbsp;in&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;classes&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester,&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;upper-division&nbsp;courses&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;list&nbsp;provided&nbsp;on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ealc.berkeley.edu/content/east-asian-humanities-major-requirements\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">our&nbsp;website</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://undergraduate.catalog.berkeley.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Berkeley&nbsp;Catalog</a>.</p><p></p><ul><li>BUDDSTD/EALANG&nbsp;C&nbsp;50&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Buddhism</li><li>Chinese&nbsp;7A&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Modern&nbsp;Chinese&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li><li>Chinese&nbsp;7B&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Pre-modern&nbsp;Chinese&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li><li>Japanese&nbsp;7A&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Modern&nbsp;Japanese&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li><li>Japanese&nbsp;7B&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Modern&nbsp;Pre-modern&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li><li>Korean&nbsp;7A&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Modern&nbsp;Korean&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li><li>Korean&nbsp;7B&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Pre-modern&nbsp;Chinese&nbsp;Literature&nbsp;and&nbsp;Culture</li></ul>",
        "groupId": "41dd7145-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 3,
        "area": "General"
      }
    ],
